{"actor":"richardhightower","ev":"01KZ2JAT7PWZ6X5C73X1ZTPDFE","git":"3c2ff9d","item":"01KZ2JAT7PCV6B34W2RK34WBX7","op":"create","set":{"body":"The pre-release evidence gate reports unlinked-evidence gaps for every closed work item, even though it is documented to check only items in a released milestone. The scope is computed and printed in each message but never used to filter, so 80% of closed items are flagged and the number grows with every item closed. Two of the project's own conventions guarantee false positives: release items are deliberately never given an external ticket, and ops chores close without a plan or a PR. The result is a release gate nobody can act on.","kind":"bug","level":"story","priority":"P2","status":"todo","title":"trace-check --strict ignores its own released-milestone scope"},"ts":"2026-08-03T01:03:11Z"}
{"actor":"richardhightower","ev":"01KZ2JCKQEPM7A7Z20JCW0BAW6","git":"3c2ff9d","item":"01KZ2JAT7PCV6B34W2RK34WBX7","op":"link","set":{"external":{"key":"291","synced_at":"2026-08-03T01:04:09Z","system":"github"}},"ts":"2026-08-03T01:04:09Z"}
{"actor":"richardhightower","ev":"01KZ2JRT7MMP4E2K8T9YJ6SX9H","git":"845f50f","item":"01KZ2JRT7MAE0MJH7Y0SJ3ZJS3","op":"create","set":{"body":"The project policy file is documented as checked into the codebase, and every agent session depends on it for work-tracking discipline, but it has never been committed. It is not gitignored either locally or globally, so a fresh clone of this repository gets no policy at all and any agent working from that clone runs with none of the rules. The sibling UI repository tracks its equivalent file correctly, which makes this repository the only one missing it. The file is also mode 600 rather than the 644 a repository file should carry.","kind":"bug","level":"task","priority":"P1","status":"todo","title":"CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md are not tracked in the source repo"},"ts":"2026-08-03T01:10:49Z"}
{"actor":"richardhightower","ev":"01KZ2JSEM4JK94Q2TMRQ1DPW7G","git":"845f50f","item":"01KZ2JRT7MAE0MJH7Y0SJ3ZJS3","op":"close","set":{"resolution":"Tracked CLAUDE.md and its AGENTS.md symlink; corrected file mode to 644.","status":"done"},"ts":"2026-08-03T01:11:10Z"}
