{"actor":"richardhightower","ev":"01KZ2KGPRMFSVC2NVGT53PE04X","git":"b446a6c","item":"01KZ2KGPRMKG9B98Q6YVD3MZVJ","op":"create","set":{"body":"Every plan page opens with the same banner regardless of whether the plan is finished, in progress, or not yet started, even though the record that produces the banner carries that status. Sixteen completed plans and four unstarted ones currently render identically. The related defect that announced plans as status reports was already fixed in v0.19.0; what remains is the missing status distinction and a silent default that hides a schema violation when a status report has no kind.","kind":"bug","level":"task","priority":"P2","status":"todo","title":"Plan banners do not distinguish a completed plan from one in flight"},"ts":"2026-08-03T01:23:52Z"}
