{"actor":"richardhightower","ev":"01KZ2M75CE9X08GEVNM8B9RSBA","git":"cef6ace","item":"01KZ2M75CEXBQHFN1AG1Z8A2YB","op":"create","set":{"body":"The generated design document and code walkthrough describe implementation details that are no longer true: a merge-ordering tiebreak that was deleted, a version constant three releases stale, and an import the module does not have. Each is the same failure: the regeneration quoted code it did not re-read. Because the wrong text predates the last release, the frozen copy for that release carries it too, and a reader reasoning about merge determinism would be actively misled.","kind":"bug","level":"task","priority":"P2","status":"todo","title":"Design docs quote code that no longer exists"},"ts":"2026-08-03T01:36:08Z"}
